                                "sense_id": "59ca9d92-d7ac-357e-9b10-156e4d6d9526",
                                "text": "The real savings of OCR come from the elimination of redundant keyboardings of the same data; from eliminating multiple verification steps; from reducing the number of documents needed to complete a transaction; […]"
